    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183360/extras/72e4afda4f5c67ea6ef8cdbd21c98be3.avif?t=1734266929\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place, a horror even for demons,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a bottomless abyss of evil, the land of oblivion and void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those unaware of the secrets, deep below the surface, the place with no light, a silent place</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > where darkness devoured any sound </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They have been suffering from hunger from time immemorial in the endless torment of sin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183360/extras/64129d45f6af2bfa0fe7a9b0096d5433.avif?t=1734266929\" width=600 height=1700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183360/extras/489f0929a73194b163ec6e2100fd38c2.avif?t=1734266929\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cat named 'Nabi' accidentally gets a light and tries to get out of the place of despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What the butterfly sees before its eyes is an endless series of doors, the door leading to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > places of terrible crime and evil.  Pride, lust, greed, jealousy, indolence, gluttony, anger </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The doors are evidence of their crime, showing their crime scene, which is why they are </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >imprisoned in this place. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no use regretting. They are already here. They entice Nabi as for those who have been</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > starved for so long, Nabi is a light.\u00a0 Can Nabi resist their temptations and escape the abyss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did Nabi come here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183360/extras/8747b3716011a19b393ee72e3ee3d085.poster.avif?t=1734266929\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183360/extras/8747b3716011a19b393ee72e3ee3d085.webm?t=1734266929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183360/extras/8747b3716011a19b393ee72e3ee3d085.mp4?t=1734266929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a jumping game that requires considerable control and patience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your mouse control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Omnibus style horror experience ( Pride, lust, greed, jealousy, indolence, gluttony, anger )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This game keeps the player in suspense from the beginning to the end with the game's</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >presentation and progression and is highly addictive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You may return to the starting point with a single mistake. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The highest immersion with a multi-dimensional auditory effect will make your mouse sweaty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game saving is not supported. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A high score table is provided.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Resist their temptations.</strong></i> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>And we hope you never come to this place on the last day.</strong></i></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183360/extras/72e4afda4f5c67ea6ef8cdbd21c98be3.avif?t=1734266929\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place, a horror even for demons,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a bottomless abyss of evil, the land of oblivion and void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those unaware of the secrets, deep below the surface, the place with no light, a silent place</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > where darkness devoured any sound </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They have been suffering from hunger from time immemorial in the endless torment of sin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183360/extras/64129d45f6af2bfa0fe7a9b0096d5433.avif?t=1734266929\" width=600 height=1700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183360/extras/489f0929a73194b163ec6e2100fd38c2.avif?t=1734266929\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cat named 'Nabi' accidentally gets a light and tries to get out of the place of despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What the butterfly sees before its eyes is an endless series of doors, the door leading to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > places of terrible crime and evil.  Pride, lust, greed, jealousy, indolence, gluttony, anger </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The doors are evidence of their crime, showing their crime scene, which is why they are </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >imprisoned in this place. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no use regretting. They are already here. They entice Nabi as for those who have been</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > starved for so long, Nabi is a light.\u00a0 Can Nabi resist their temptations and escape the abyss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did Nabi come here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183360/extras/8747b3716011a19b393ee72e3ee3d085.poster.avif?t=1734266929\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183360/extras/8747b3716011a19b393ee72e3ee3d085.webm?t=1734266929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183360/extras/8747b3716011a19b393ee72e3ee3d085.mp4?t=1734266929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a jumping game that requires considerable control and patience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your mouse control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Omnibus style horror experience ( Pride, lust, greed, jealousy, indolence, gluttony, anger )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This game keeps the player in suspense from the beginning to the end with the game's</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >presentation and progression and is highly addictive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You may return to the starting point with a single mistake. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The highest immersion with a multi-dimensional auditory effect will make your mouse sweaty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game saving is not supported. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A high score table is provided.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Resist their temptations.</strong></i> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>And we hope you never come to this place on the last day.</strong></i></h2>",
